 =http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fac%2F49%2Fc3af60004e80b39b
 4e98f1aa5797%2Fclass-2418.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Are you looking for ways to improve your photographs\, taken w
 ith camera or cell phone? Maybe there's something you didn't mean to be in
  the shot\, or the photo is not quite sharp enough\, or at a bit of an ang
 le\, or too dark\, or the sky is just plain blah. In this course you'll le
 arn how to use the magic of Adobe Photoshop to enhance your photographs in
  many different ways. You’ll also learn how to make your own greeting ca
 rds for all occasions\, and create portraits of family\, friends\, and pet
 s.\n NOTE: This is a hands-on course. Students will need to have the lates
 t version of Adobe Photoshop or Adobe Photoshop Elements installed on thei
 r home computers (Adobe Photoshop available here).\nTickets: ivytech.edu/c
 ll
