DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261013T170000
UID:882588d07923dd40a470fedb44968837@ipm.org
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the first annual performing arts career fair at IU
 -Bloomington!\n Whether you’re in the first year of your degree or getti
 ng ready to graduate\, the first annual JSOM Career Fair is a great opport
 unity for students of all disciplines at Jacobs to connect with regional e
 mployers\, learn about career paths in performing arts\, and explore inter
 nships and job opportunities. The focus of this fair will be employers int
 erested in attracting professionals with skills and experience in performa
 nce and applied teaching in music\, dance\, and theatre. Watch your IU inb
 ox for information on how to prepare for the fair\, and schedule an appoin
 tment with a career advisor to make sure your resumé is fair-ready!
LOCATION:Musical Arts Center Lobby\, 101 N Eagleson Ave\, Bloomington\, In
 diana 47406
