BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ballet Hispánico New York
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261014T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261014T235900
UID:02d3f3aff63aa0f10afff57de679be2d@ipm.org
DESCRIPTION:Presented by IU Auditorium\nBallet Hispánico New York is the 
 nation’s leading American Latino dance company and the largest cultural 
 institution of its kind in the United States. For over five decades\, it h
 as been a beacon of artistic excellence\, celebrated for its bold repertor
 y and exceptional training programs.\n The Bloomington performance will be
  an evening-length presentation of CARMEN.maquia. Since the debut in 1875
 \, Carmen\, the titular character from Bizet’s opera\, has become a time
 less cultural icon\, inspiring generations of composers\, choreographers\,
  and writers to attempt to capture her elusive and alluring nature.\n Ball
 et Hispánico honors the powerful Spanish leading lady with Gustavo Ramír
 ez Sansano’s electrifying CARMEN.maquia. One of today’s most sought-af
 ter choreographers\, Sansano’s quintessential ballet invigorates this ti
 meless tale with an unrelenting energy that leaves you breathless. Highly 
 original and full of explosive movement\, CARMEN.maquia is a bold reimagin
 ing of this tragic tale.\nTickets: https://www.iuauditorium.com/events/det
 ail/ballethispanico-2026
LOCATION:IU Auditorium\, 1211 East 7th Street\, Bloomington\, Indiana 4740
 5
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/ballet-hispanico-new-york
 -05-08-2026-13-11-47
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
