 7pm – $10 Admission. Veteran’s Appreciation Day – veterans and activ
 e-duty military admitted free\, Monroe County Veteran’s Services info ta
 ble. \n Friday\, October 16th\, 9am-7pm – FREE Admission. \n Saturday\, 
