 Fire District firefighters. \n Monday\, October 19th\, 9am-6pm – FREE Ad
 mission. $10 Bag It Day. Fill unlimited bags for $10 each. Better Books $2
 0 Bag It – limit one.\n Tuesday\, October 20th\, 9am-6pm – FREE Admiss
 ion. $5 Bag It Day. Fill unlimited bags for $5 each. Better Books closed
