 a65aebbf634548%2Fzachwilliams-fa26-1080x1080-main.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by IU Auditorium\nGet ready to experience a revival!
  Presented by Awakening Events\, Zach Williams’ Revival Nights Tour has 
 an energy this fall that’s a little gritty\, a lot louder\, and always r
 eal. This is more than just a concert—it’s a night of revival and rene
 wal.\n Zach Williams has the power behind “Chain Breaker” and “Rescu
 e Story” while Cochren & Co. make waves with their favorites like “Chu
 rch (Take Me Back)” and “Running Home.” Singer/Songwriter Christian 
 Hohn opens the night with new music that tells his story of faith in way t
 hat suits this tour’s theme of everyday life\, struggle\, and redemption
 . \n Come as you are and experience the transforming power of music\, wors
 hip and community. A limited number of Revival Nights VIP tickets offer be
 st seating\, early merch shopping\, and a Meet & Greet with photo opportun
 ity with Zach Williams. Grab your seats before they’re gone!\nTickets: h
 ttps://www.iuauditorium.com/events/detail/zachwilliams-2026
LOCATION:IU Auditorium\, 1211 East 7th Street\, Bloomington\, Indiana 4740
