 ce2fd628d4e68a%2Face-still-life-flyer.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by The Arts Federation\nractice the art of drawing f
 rom observation in this hands-on still life drawing class! Each class will
  feature a new arrangement of objects for students to observe and interpre
 t through drawing. You’ll explore composition\, proportion\, light\, val
 ue\, and different drawing techniques while building confidence in your ob
 servational skills.\n This class is open to adults\, as well as students i
 n Grades 10–12\, and is\nwelcoming to artists of varying experience leve
 ls. The class will primarily use\nvine charcoal\, with pencils also availa
 ble for those who prefer working in graphite. Students with previous still
  life drawing experience are welcome to bring their own preferred drawing 
 materials.\n Instructor: Tracey Jen\n Location: The Arts Federation (638 N
 orth St\, Lafayette\, IN 47901) - Art Studio\n Time: Saturdays\, 1:00pm - 
 2:00pm\n Tuition: $150 (must be paid in full – this class cannot be take
 n on a week-to-week basis)\n Full Schedule:\n Saturday\, September 12\, 1:
 00 – 2:00 pm\nSaturday\, September 26\, 1:00 – 2:00 pm\nSaturday\, Oct
 ober 3\, 1:00 – 2:00 pm\nSaturday\, October 10\, 1:00 – 2:00 pm\nSatur
 day\, October 17\, 1:00 – 2:00 pm\nSaturday\, October 24\, 1:00 – 2:00
  pm\nSaturday\, November 7\, 1:00 – 2:00 pm\nSaturday\, November 14\, 1:
 00 – 2:00 pm\nSaturday\, November 21\, 1:00 – 2:00 pm (Make-up session
 \, if\nneeded.)\nTickets: https://pci.jotform.com/form/262025259652154
LOCATION:The Arts Federation\, 638 North Street\, Lafayette\, Indiana 4790
 1
