DESCRIPTION:Experience the heroism of My Hero Academia In Concert\, celebr
 ating 10 years of unforgettable adventures! From Deku’s first steps to t
 he thrilling battles\, this live concert brings the anime’s full eight-s
 eason journey to life on stage. Accompanied by an 15-piece live band perfo
 rming Yuki Hayashi’s iconic score perfectly synced with striking visuals
  of your favorite scenes\, every note captures the triumph\, heartbreak\, 
 and courage of Class 1-A creating an immersive concert experience for fans
  new and old alike.\n Feel the ultimate hero energy as the stage comes ali
 ve with inspiring characters\, epic moments\, and emotional storytelling f
 rom all eight seasons. Whether you’ve followed Deku and his classmates f
 rom the beginning or are discovering the world of heroes for the first tim
 e\, this concert is a musical adventure you won’t want to miss.\n Celebr
 ate 10 years of My Hero Academia and join us for an unforgettable evening 
 of music\, action\, and heart!\nTickets: https://www.iuauditorium.com/even
 ts/detail/myheroacademia-2026
LOCATION:IU Auditorium\, 1211 East 7th Street\, Bloomington\, Indiana 4740
 5
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/my-hero-academia-live-in-
 concert-22-04-2026-13-17-20
