 90f/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1920x1080+0+0/resize/254x143!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fcb%2Ff5%2F6b5772724e6686
 bc34ba98762166%2F103126-the-exorcist-1920x1080-no-text.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Buskirk-Chumley Theater\nOne of the most iconic h
 orror movies ever made\, this tale of an exorcism is based loosely on actu
 al events.\nA HALLOWEEN MUST SEE!\n When young Regan (Linda Blair) starts 
 acting odd — levitating\, speaking in tongues — her worried mother (El
 len Burstyn) seeks medical help\, only to hit a dead end.\n A local priest
  (Jason Miller)\, however\, thinks the girl may be seized by the devil.\n 
 The priest makes a request to perform an exorcism\, and the church sends i
 n an expert (Max von Sydow) to help with the difficult job.\n LENGTH: 2hr 
 2mins\nFORMAT: DCP\nRATED: R\nTickets: https://buskirkchumley.org/events/t
 he-exorcist-1973-october-31-2026/
LOCATION:Buskirk-Chumley Theater\, 114 E Kirkwood Ave\, Bloomington\, Indi
 ana 47408
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/the-exorcist-1973-19-09-2
 026-13-25-21
