DESCRIPTION:Presented by Morgenstern Collective\nSpice of Life is a new Bl
 oomington series celebrating music and community in a family-friendly sett
 ing\, produced by Rick Morgenstern. This inaugural event features 8-piece 
 powerhouse band Living Proof\, Indiana's #1 cover band\, with Brother Will
 iam of The Soul Kitchen as master of ceremonies. Enjoy live music\, dancin
 g\, delicious appetizers\, cash bar\, music trivia contest\, and an on-sit
 e children’s program.\nTickets: https://events.humanitix.com/spice-of-li
 fe
