ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/d281
 364/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1275x1875+0+0/resize/254x374!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2F19%2F0b%2Fb70063f241cc8b
 7b157b9edc80bf%2Fcg-event-postcard-templatefinal1.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Common Ground Films\nGo Beyond is a benefit dinne
 r raising the final funds to send blind Navy veteran Lonnie Bedwell to the
  North Pole\, the last leg of his Explorers Grand Slam.\n Every ticket and
  sponsorship helps complete Beyond Vision\, the feature documentary chroni
 cling his journey from losing his sight in 1997 to conquering all seven su
 mmits.\n Join us for cocktails\, dinner\, a filmmaker panel\, a silent auc
 tion\, and an exclusive first look at scenes from the film\, all in celebr
 ation of a story that proves no summit is out of reach.\nTickets: https://
 www.commongroundfilms.org/gobeyond
LOCATION:The Woolery Mill\, 2250 W Sunstone Dr\, Bloomington\, Indiana 474
 03
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/go-beyond-2026-21-08-2026
 -09-43-17
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
