BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:WonderLab New Year's Eve
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261231T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261231T180000
UID:92a5a69f14fbbbcec5d2125a07389d61@ipm.org
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://npr.brightspotcdn.com/dims4/default/9216
 d44/2147483647/strip/true/crop/1080x1080+0+0/resize/254x254!/quality/90/?u
 rl=http%3A%2F%2Fnpr-brightspot.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fb8%2Ffe%2Fd8c9b99647cf8e
 0fcc50b22c6041%2F1080x1080-logo.png
DESCRIPTION:Presented by WonderLab Science Museum\nRing in the New Year th
 e WonderLab way — with an early countdown made just for kids!\n Get read
 y to glow. Explore all things that shine\, sparkle\, and light up\, and un
 cover the science behind the shine. Let the kids get their wiggles out wit
 h dancing\, games\, and a countdown of their very own — so by the time t
 he ball drops for the grown-ups\, they're happily worn out and ready for b
 ed.\nTickets: https://fareharbor.com/embeds/book/wonderlab/items/746766/?f
 ull-items=yes&amp\;flow=no
LOCATION:Wonderlab\, 308 W 4th St\, Bloomington\, Indiana 47401
URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/event/wonderlab-new-years-eve-1
 5-09-2026-14-18-39
X-SOURCE:WFIU Community Calendar
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.ipm.org/community-calendar/
END:VEVENT
